---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="PULSS — Kelly-Leontine Merilo">
  <div class="cs-wrap">

    <!-- ── PAGE TITLE ── -->
    <div class="cs-page-header">
      <h1 class="cs-page-title">PULSS</h1>
      <p class="cs-page-sub">Charity Youth Festival Website</p>
    </div>

    <!-- ── HERO IMAGE ── -->
    <div class="cs-hero-img">
      <img src="/pulss-screen1.png" alt="PULSS landing page mockup" />
    </div>

    <!-- ── ACCORDION SECTIONS ── -->
    <div class="cs-accordion">

      <div class="cs-item">
        <button class="cs-item-header" aria-expanded="true">
          <span class="cs-item-title">About the Project</span>
          <span class="cs-item-arrow">↓</span>
        </button>
        <div class="cs-item-body open">
          <p class="cs-body">
            PULSS is an imaginary youth festival in Tallinn with the goal of giving
            young people a chance to actually participate, not just be part of the audience.
            I designed the website in Figma as part of my UI Design 1 course, covering
            everything from the landing page to artist registration and event timetables.
          </p>
          <div class="cs-meta-row">
            <span class="cs-meta-item"><span class="cs-meta-label">Tool</span> Figma</span>
            <span class="cs-meta-item"><span class="cs-meta-label">Type</span> UI/UX Design</span>
            <span class="cs-meta-item"><span class="cs-meta-label">Context</span> University project</span>
            <span class="cs-meta-item"><span class="cs-meta-label">Event</span> 24–25 Aug 2026, Tallinn</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cs-item">
        <button class="cs-item-header" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="cs-item-title">The Challenge</span>
          <span class="cs-item-arrow">↓</span>
        </button>
        <div class="cs-item-body">
          <p class="cs-body">
            The hardest part was finding the right vibe — something that didn't feel too clinical
            but also not too chaotic, while still keeping that charitable feeling intact. The red
            and blue provided were also quite challenging since finding the right shades that worked
            together took a lot of trial and error.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cs-item">
        <button class="cs-item-header" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="cs-item-title">The Process</span>
          <span class="cs-item-arrow">↓</span>
        </button>
        <div class="cs-item-body">
          <p class="cs-body">
            Finding the visual style required a lot of experimentation. I used red as an accent
            color but decided to go with a different color for the CTAs. I chose dark tones to
            capture the feeling of a festival. The main focus was on the desktop view but I also
            designed a mobile version alongside it. I tried working with a design system and
            reusable components for the first time.
          </p>
          <div class="cs-screens">
            <img src="/pulss-screen2.png" alt="PULSS key screens" />
            <img src="/pulss-screen3.png" alt="PULSS registration" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cs-item">
        <button class="cs-item-header" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="cs-item-title">What I Learned</span>
          <span class="cs-item-arrow">↓</span>
        </button>
        <div class="cs-item-body">
          <p class="cs-body">
            The schedule section still isn't where I want it to be, but with better references
            it's something I could improve in the future. Working with a real colour system for
            the first time taught me a lot about consistency and reusability in design.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- ── PROTOTYPE BTN ── -->
    <div class="cs-proto-wrap">
      <a
        href="https://www.figma.com/proto/v5nvqOsmZDn97oRbh7aSSH/Pulss?node-id=133-94&t=4hsX65caN3ZD1uSv-1&scaling=min-zoom&content-scaling=fixed&page-id=0%3A1&starting-point-node-id=133%3A94&show-proto-sidebar=1"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="cs-proto-btn"
      >PROTOTYPE</a>
    </div>

    <!-- ── BACK ── -->
    <div class="cs-back">
      <a href="/#projects" class="cs-back-link">← Back to works</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

  .cs-wrap {
    background: #00004C;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding-top: 56px;
    font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
  }

  /* ── page header ── */
  .cs-page-header {
    padding: 60px 80px 32px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .cs-page-title {
    font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 8vw, 96px);
    color: #FF315A;
    line-height: 1;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .cs-page-sub {
    font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 22px);
    color: #D7DAFF;
    margin-top: 8px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  /* ── hero image ── */
  .cs-hero-img {
    padding: 0 80px 0;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto 0;
  }
  .cs-hero-img img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 49, 90, 0.3);
  }

  /* ── accordion ── */
  .cs-accordion {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 80px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 49, 90, 0.25);
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .cs-item {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 49, 90, 0.25);
  }

  .cs-item-header {
    width: 100%;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 28px 0;
    text-align: left;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .cs-item-title {
    font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 36px);
    color: #fff;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .cs-item-header:hover .cs-item-title,
  .cs-item-header[aria-expanded="true"] .cs-item-title {
    color: #FF315A;
  }

  .cs-item-arrow {
    font-size: 24px;
    color: #FF315A;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cs-item-header[aria-expanded="true"] .cs-item-arrow {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  /* ── item body ── */
  .cs-item-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: 0fr;
    transition: grid-template-rows 0.35s ease;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cs-item-body.open {
    grid-template-rows: 1fr;
  }

  .cs-item-body > * {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cs-item-body .cs-body {
    padding-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .cs-body {
    font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(15px, 1.4vw, 18px);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  /* meta row */
  .cs-meta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 32px;
    padding-bottom: 32px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .cs-meta-item {
    font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #D7DAFF;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .cs-meta-label {
    color: #FF315A;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  /* screens inside accordion */
  .cs-screens {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    padding-bottom: 32px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  .cs-screens img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 49, 90, 0.25);
  }

  /* ── prototype btn ── */
  .cs-proto-wrap {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 64px 80px;
  }

  .cs-proto-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #3546FF;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 18px 80px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .cs-proto-btn:hover { background: #5566ff; }

  /* ── back ── */
  .cs-back {
    padding: 0 80px 56px;
  }
  .cs-back-link {
    font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgba(215, 218, 255, 0.5);
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .cs-back-link:hover { color: #FF315A; }

  /* ── responsive ── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .cs-page-header,
    .cs-hero-img,
    .cs-accordion,
    .cs-proto-wrap,
    .cs-back {
      padding-left: 24px;
      padding-right: 24px;
    }
    .cs-screens { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.cs-item-header').forEach(btn => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const body = btn.nextElementSibling as HTMLElement;
      const isOpen = btn.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';

      // close all
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.cs-item-header').forEach(b => {
        b.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
        const bd = b.nextElementSibling as HTMLElement;
        bd.classList.remove('open');
      });

      // open clicked if it was closed
      if (!isOpen) {
        btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
        body.classList.add('open');
      }
    });
  });
</script>
